RE: SECOND LEVEL OF THE COURTS BUILDING,308WEST17TSTREET
Dear Vicki,
thefinish ofthe 2ndfloorat 308West 17th Street as an amendment to our contract #6892forthe Cheyenne
Municipal Courts Project.
Project Understanding
The City of Cheyenne would like to occupy the 2nd floor of the Cheyenne Municipal Courts Building.
In an effort to be good stewards with tax dollars, the City is attempting to incorporate the construction
of the finish of the 2nd Floor with the Cheyenne Municipal Courts Project(the main level of the same
building).In order to achieve this task, the 95% Construction Drawings for the 2nd floorfinish would
need tobe complete by March18,2019 and thefinal Construction Drawings submitted April22,2019.
Although there are initial concepts of which City Departments will be occupying the 2nd floor, a final
determination has not been made.The City has requested architectural assistance to help identify spatial
considerations for 3 to4 City Departments being considered for relocation to the 2nd floor. The City
will then determine what Departments are tobe included in thefinal design and the Design Team will
provide full architectural and engineering services to complete Construction Documents for thefinish
of the 2nd floor.
Increase in Scope of Design Services
Our proposal is based upon the following:
1.Preliminary discussions with the City regarding the possibility of finishing the 2nd floor of the
Cheyenne Municipal Courts Project.
2.There will be four (4) City Departments that will be evaluated for the possibility of relocating
and incorporation into this Project.
Architectural
1.Provide Programming Services for the City Departments as described above.
2.Provide Schematic Design illustrating the spatial considerations and relationships for the City
Departments being considered for relocation as described above.
3.Provide Design Development Services and Construction Documents.
Mechanical+Electrical
1.HVAC design for finishing of the 2ndfloor.
2.Plumbing design for the new plumbing fixtures for the 2nd floor.Fixture counts to be determined
by the Architect.
