We are pleased to provide you with a proposal to address the increase in our Scope of Work
pursuit to our Contract #6892 to accommodate the City's decisionto add a second-level to the
Cheyenne Municipal Courts project located at308West17h Street.
Project Understanding
The City of Cheyenne wishes to add the design of a second level(shell and core)to the
Cheyenne Municipal Court Project.Noel Griffith Jr.& Associates Architects is currently
under contract with the City(#6892)for the designof the single-level Municipal Courts.
Increase in Scope of Design Services
Our proposal for the second level is based upon the following:
1.Preliminary Cost Model dated August 20,2018.
2.City Council discussion October 24,2018.
3.The tenant/occupant of the second level will be a City Entity.
4. Investigate integrating historical elements in the exterior facades.
5.Design of Shell and Core Only for the Second Level.
a.The design and construction of the exterior facades (both first and second
levels)including all exterior materials to complete the exterior appearance,
exterior windows, insulation, and vapor barrier.Interior drywall on the
exterior walls of the secondlevel will onlybe installed to the extent required
by code forfire-walls, separations, etc.The exterior walls of the second level
will notinclude electrical power, ITorAV.
b.The floorplan forthe second level will include elevator, stairwells mechanical,
electrical, IT and restroom locations.General layout ofinterior walls or
partitions will not be designed or constructed for the second level.
i.The mechanical, electrical and IT designated areas/rooms on the
second level will be designed and finished for the installation of the
